{"suttaId":"thi-ap5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6649,6675],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"thi-ap5:0.3":"Naḷamālikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap5:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, ahosiṃ kinnarī tadā;","thi-ap5:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ.","thi-ap5:2.1":"“Pasannacittā sumanā, vedajātā katañjalī;","thi-ap5:2.3":"Naḷamālaṃ gahetvāna, sayambhuṃ abhipūjayiṃ.","thi-ap5:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap5:3.3":"Jahitvā kinnarīdehaṃ, agacchiṃ tidasaṃ gatiṃ.","thi-ap5:4.1":"“Chattiṃsadevarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap5:4.3":"Dasannaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap5:4.5":"Saṃvejetvāna me cittaṃ [vedayitvāna kusalaṃ (syā.), saṃvedayitvā kusalaṃ (pī.)], pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap5:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā [bhavā saṃghātitā mama (ka.)];","thi-ap5:5.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap5:6.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","thi-ap5:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pupphapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap5:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap5:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap5:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap5:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ naḷamālikā therī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap5:11.1":"Naḷamālikātheriyāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
